  {
    "path": "urwidgets/docs/PERFORMANCE.md",
    "language": "markdown",
    "sizeBytes": 473,
    "lines": 5,
    "content": "# URWidgets Performance Engineering (v3.0.1)\n\n- **Single Rust Process (`urwidgets-daemon`)**: All 10 desktop widgets share one background process (`~4.2 MB RSS`).\n- **Debounced SQLite Autosave**: `NotesWidget.qml` uses a 400ms debounce `Timer` so rapid typing never blocks the UI thread or floods SQLite.\n- **Lazy Image Decoding**: `WidgetBackground.qml` and `PhotoWidget.qml` bind `sourceSize` to the widget's pixel dimensions with `asynchronous: true` and `cache: true`.\n"
  }
